# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Printed QR codes point at escapepack.ca/help/<game>/ paths,
# so these must never be removed once printed.
# 302 (temporary) so the target can change later without browsers caching the old one.
# Kit-built backpacks: /help/<slug>/hints/ is generated by build.sh.
/help/space          /help/space/hints/   302
/help/space/         /help/space/hints/   302
/designer/clues    /design/clues/    301
/designer/clues/*  /design/clues/:splat  301
/Hiking.html          /hiking-old.html                            301
